{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GO-PENDING function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309742","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GO-PENDING-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GO-PENDING-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GO-PENDING function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a TRUE value if, within an EDITING\nphrase, an APPLY statement results in a GO action. The GO action\nis deferred until the end of the EDITING phrase.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This function\nis supported only for backward compatibility. </p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__note_N10033_N10024_N10021_N10001\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Does\nnot apply to SpeedScript programming.</div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__syntax_GC18OT2694067\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d8388e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__idGDL2IW2671305\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GO-PENDING</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__example_GC18OU2694071\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d8388e128\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The <span class=\"ph filepath\">r-gopend.p</span> procedure\nlets you update some of the fields in each customer record. If you\npress <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">GO</strong> when the value in the current\nbalance field is greater than the balance in the credit-limit field,\nthe UPDATE statement does not end. Instead, it continues prompting\nyou for input until you correct the problem and then press <strong class=\"ph b keylabel\">GO</strong>.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-gopend.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__idGDL2IX2671309\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>REPEAT:\n  PROMPT-FOR Customer.CustNum.\n  FIND Customer USING Customer.CustNum.\n  UPDATE\n    Customer.Name Customer.Address Customer.City Customer.State SKIP\n    Customer.CreditLimit Customer.Balance WITH 1 COLUMN EDITING:\n    READKEY.\n    APPLY LASTKEY.\n    IF <strong class=\"ph b\">GO-PENDING</strong> AND INPUT Customer.Balance &gt; \n      INPUT Customer.CreditLimit THEN DO:\n      MESSAGE &quot;The current unpaid balance exceeds the credit limit.&quot;.\n      NEXT.\n    END.\n  END. /* EDITING */\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GO-PENDING-function__see-also_GC18OV2694081\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d8388e175\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"APPLY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/APPLY-statement.html\">APPLY statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"EDITING-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EDITING-phrase.html\">EDITING phrase</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT-function.html\">GET-UNSIGNED-SHORT function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GT-or-gt-operator.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GT-or-gt-operator.html\">GT or &gt; operator</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309742","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GO-PENDING function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GO-PENDING-function.html","type":"Manual"}